  "precision_control": "The same runtime-Dual coefficient buffer used for a 256-bit lane is reused for a 53-bit lane (pointer identity asserted). All six components, full ordered shape, numerical values and separate real/imaginary Float precision metadata match fresh amplitudes through widths 3,1,0,2,3 with 53/192/256-bit inputs.",
  "transactionality_control": "Each direct box/triangle/bubble/tadpole reducer warms both output banks, then fails its final numerator callback twice after partial scratch writes. Every public field and coefficient buffer pointer stays unchanged; successful retry reproduces output. Amplitude controls cover every callback position, failed lanes, reset/grow/shrink/empty batches, cut stops 1/4/2/6/3/1 and accumulation against fresh execution.",
